        # Any reachable total_distance is a multiple of g
        # So we need g to divide (t - s % t) in mod arithmetic
        # Which is: g divides ((t - 1) % t + 1 - s % t) if s > 0

        # Simplify: (s + k*g) % t == 0 for some k >= 0
        # Need to check if there exists k where this has solution

        if g == 0:
